<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1787509720"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:15.111"><div begin="31.626" end="44.649" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="31.626" end="34.120" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.626" end="32.688">我等</span><span begin="32.688" end="33.492">的模</span><span begin="33.492" end="34.120">样</span></p><p begin="34.139" end="36.618" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.139" end="34.923">好不</span><span begin="34.923" end="35.520">具</span><span begin="35.520" end="36.618">象</span></p><p begin="39.538" end="42.143" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.538" end="41.062">用皮肤</span><span begin="41.062" end="41.446">感</span><span begin="41.446" end="42.143">受</span></p><p begin="42.158" end="44.649" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.158" end="42.721">你</span><span begin="42.721" end="43.349">的流</span><span begin="43.349" end="44.649">向</span></p></div><div begin="47.396" end="1:00.812" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="47.396" end="50.225" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.396" end="48.994">你竟然能</span><span begin="48.994" end="49.523">做</span><span begin="49.523" end="50.225">到</span></p><p begin="50.235" end="53.375" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.235" end="50.523">带</span><span begin="50.523" end="51.044">走</span><span begin="51.044" end="51.569">阳</span><span begin="51.569" end="53.375">光</span></p><p begin="55.394" end="58.424" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.394" end="55.739">我</span><span begin="55.739" end="57.481">一味的跟</span><span begin="57.481" end="58.424">随</span></p><p begin="58.679" end="1:00.812" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.679" end="59.443">过了</span><span begin="59.443" end="1:00.812">量</span></p></div><div begin="1:02.103" end="1:18.365" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:02.103" end="1:03.451" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.103" end="1:03.451">Oh</span></p><p begin="1:03.461" end="1:05.963" itunes:key="L10"